> list should contain the quantiles of the posterior draws that will be plotted as the longer, thinner line. The |inner|
> element of the list should contain the quantiles of posterior draws that will be plotted as the shorter, thicker line.

> If missing, the default is to use |list(outer=c(0.025,0.975),inner=c(0.16,0.84))|, which corresponds to 95% and 68%

> credible intervals." By default, all parallel chains are collapsed into one chain before plotting.
