Subject: Re: [stan-dev] piecewise (0,inf) -> (-inf,inf) transform?
Message-ID: <txlxRYscxOU.6LuHkZKcbYAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <txlxRYscxOU.G7CDknwYUVQJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
