Fixed it and pushed. There was a bug in ub_constrain() where it was
subtracting instead of adding, which meant that the model got infinite
points for setting beta=-1e-5. Seems to work fine now--the estimates
agree with the published BUGS estimates.

Perhaps this also explains the 1/10th% problem that Daniel was looking into?

Matt

