What's epsilon.0?

Hmm.  The BDA report from R2WinBUGS (p. 594) has:

   sigma.theta = 6.5, sd = 5.7, n.eff = 23

With MCMC error = sd / sqrt(n.eff) = 1, that's
a pretty fat target.  Do we have a better idea of what it should
really be?  I'm not sure I trust the n.eff enough
to trust the MCMC se.

