The bounce is a replacement for, and not an addition to, the regular momentum update.  You just have to change your code to an if/else

phi <- phi + 0.5*epsilon*gradient.th <http://gradient.th> (th, y, s.y)
for (l in 1:L){
 th <- th + epsilon*phi
 if (th[10] < 0) {

   phi[10] <- - phi[10]
 }

else {

 phi <- phi + (if (l==L) 0.5 else 1)*epsilon*gradient.th <http://gradient.th> (th, y, s.y)
}
phi <- -phi

